Author: Scott Sunarto <github@smsunarto.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 18:49:21 2026 -0800

    feat(t3-composer): show permission modes by name alone
    
    The permission picker's rows now show each mode's icon, label and check,
    without the description line; a mode above the machine's limit still says why
    it is unavailable. The trigger's tooltip names only the mode. The unused
    description field leaves permission-modes.ts. Rows land at 32px on desktop and
    48px on phones.

